or into growth accountability. Nebuly is building that same layer for AI — turning millions of invisible conversations into a clear answer on value.<br /><br />Our customers include Oura, CNH Industrial, Vodafone, and Moncler. Demand is accelerating fast, and we're building the team to match.</p><h2><strong><br />Your Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We have a product that works, customers that prove it, and a market that is moving fast. DACH is one of the core regions we are pushing alongside the US, UK, and Italy — it is not an experiment, it is a strategic priority. In DACH we have early presence but huge white space. No one owns this market yet - not us, not a competitor. The person who takes this role has the opportunity to build a book of business from scratch in a category that every large enterprise will need to buy into over the next three years.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you have spent the last decade building the right relationships in DACH and you are ready to put them to work in a market that is genuinely early, this is your moment. You will report directly to the Co-founder, have a sales engineer to handle technical discovery, and a channel person alongside you to build the partner ecosystem. Your job is to generate pipeline, navigate deals, and close.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">No VP of Sales between you and the decision maker. No committee to approve your approach. Just a big market, a working product, and room to run.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Generate pipeline fast - primarily through your existing network. There is no inbound engine, no SDR handing you leads. You eat what you kill.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the full sales cycle end to end: sourcing → pilot → business case → negotiation → close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Target mid-market and enterprise accounts with €100K+ ACV potential, navigating multi-stakeholder deals across product, AI, IT, legal, and procurement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the face of Nebuly in DACH - at events, in conversations, in the market</p></li></ul><h2><strong> </strong></h2><h2><strong>Who You Are</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6+ years of enterprise or mid-market B2B SaaS sales experience in DACH</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of closing multiple <strong>7-figure enterprise contracts</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Active <strong>network</strong> of prospects and decision-makers in the DACH enterprise space</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable in <strong>technical sales conversations</strong> (with CTOs, ML teams, data leads)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You know how to win deals without inbound or SDRs - <strong>you drive your own pipeline</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working alongside system integrators and advisory firms - you know how to bring them into a deal, co-sell with them, and build the relationship that eventually generates referrals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with ambiguity, a lean process, and building as you go</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in German and English</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">You do not need to have sold AI observability or conversational analytics before. You need to know the buyers and know how to sell.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Bonus Points</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience as a first sales hire or market launcher</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Background in data, analytics, ML infrastructure, or developer tools</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What We Offer</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>White space.</strong> There is no incumbent AE in DACH to st