rs, making us one of the world’s Top 40 most popular projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top investors, from Sequoia’s first German seed to our SAP's recent strategic investment - bringing us to a $5.2bn valuation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />That’s the company we’ve built. Now we’d love to see what <em>you </em>can build. If you’re applying, try n8n out - whether you’re technical or not - and share a screenshot of your first workflow with us. The easiest place to start is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🎯 Your main goal will be to build and lead a high-performing Deployment Strategist team that helps n8n's enterprise customers turn automation opportunities into measurable business impact. You'll own the methodology that drives successful Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) engagements, accelerating customer adoption, getting high-value workflows into production, and enabling customers to become independent builders.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">To achieve this, you'll focus on four key areas:</p><h3>Build &amp; Lead the Deployment Strategist Team</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hire, onboard, and coach a team of Deployment Strategists who partner with Forward Deployed Engineers to deliver high-impact customer engagements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set a high bar for executive discovery, ROI definition, change management, and customer handovers, ensuring consistent delivery quality across the team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay hands-on by leading customer engagements yourself while building the team, creating a culture of ownership, continuous learning, and customer impact.</p></li></ul><h3>Own &amp; Scale the Deployment Methodology</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and continuously improve our four-phase engagement methodology (Define, Identify, Co-build, Handover), including ROI frameworks, discovery guides, opportunity assessments, and handover templates.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with CSMs, AEs, and Sales leadership to identify and qualify high-impact customer opportunities, define clear success criteria, and scope the right engagement model.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn learnings from workshops, hackathons, on-site builds, and staff augmentation engagements into repeatable playbooks that scale across FDE, Customer Success, and partner teams.</p></li></ul><h3>Drive Customer Adoption &amp; Business Outcomes</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead executive discovery and ROI conversations to align customer stakeholders on high-value automation opportunities, success metrics, and organizational change.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measure engagement success through workflows deployed to production, customer adoption improvements, and measurable business outcomes, rather than services delivery alone.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure seamless handovers to Customer Success Managers and provide CS and GTM leadership with visibility into engagement results, customer ROI, and expansion opportunities.</p></li></ul><h3>Scale Delivery Quality &amp; Cross-functional Collaboration</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the Partner Delivery Manager and Partnerships teams to ensure external delivery partners follow the same engagement methodology and quality standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help define readiness, certification, and quality expectations for partner Deployment Strategists to enable consistent customer experiences at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with FDEs, Product, and Engineering to turn customer feedback, technical gaps, feature requests, and custom integration needs into actionable product insights.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3><strong>Must-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤝 Enterprise Customer Experience:</strong> You have 7+ years of experience in customer-facing roles such as professional services, solutions consulting, implementation, or customer success within a software company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🌟 People Leadership:</strong> You have 2+ years of experience leading, coaching, and developing customer-facing teams, with a track record of building high-performing teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 0-to-1 Builder Experience:</strong> You've built or scaled a deployment, implementation, or professional services function and know how to create structure and repeatable processes in an evolving environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💼 Executive Stakeholder Management:</strong> You're experienced in leading executive discovery, building compelling ROI cases, and securing buy-in from multiple stakeholders within enterprise organizations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Technical Fluency:</strong> You're comfortable discussing workflow automation, integrations, and AI use cases with technical stakeholders and collaborating closely with engineers without needing to write code yourself.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📊 Operational Excellence:</strong> You know how to define success metrics, build scalable methodologies, and turn customer engagement learnings into actionable playbooks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎯 Customer Outcome Mindset:</strong> You're focused on driving measurable customer adoption and long-term value, rather than simply delivering projects or completing engagements.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⚡ Automation Platforms:</strong> You're familiar with n8n or other workflow automation, integration, or low-code platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🔄 Change Management:</strong> You have experience helping enterprise organizations drive adoption, navigate organizational change, and embed new technologies into their ways of working.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤝 Partner Ecosystems:</strong> You've worked with systems integrators, consulting firms, or external delivery partners to deliver customer implementations or technical engagements.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At n8n, you'll have the opportunity to build a brand-new function at the heart of how we scale enterprise customer adoption. You won't just manage a team — you'll shape how we engage customers, demonstrate the value of automation, and turn high-impact use cases into production workflows that drive lasting business outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work closely with leaders across Customer Success, Sales, Product, and Engineering, with significant visibility and influence over our enterprise growth strategy. As one of Europe's fastest-growing startups, we offer the opportunity to build from the ground up, experiment with new approaches, and create a scalable deployment model that helps customers become independent, successful builders.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll join a supportive, remote-first team that values autonomy, collaboration, and continuous learning, where your impact will be visible from day one.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like a challenge you're excited to take on?</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply now — and help us build the future of automation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>n8n is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We can sponsor visas to Germany; for any other country, you need to have existing right to work.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Our company language is English.</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>You care about diversity and inclusion? We do too! Check out our </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35?pvs=21"><em>Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging initiatives at n8n</em></a><em> (</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35"><em>https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35</em></a><em>).</em></p><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Location disclaimer:</strong> If you see multiple job postings for the same role, it is most likely because we're hiring remotely for this role and posting in different locations to make sure every potential candidate can see the role. Please apply to the location you're the most likely to work from in the future. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Benefits </strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Competitive compensation</strong> 💸 – We offer fair and attractive pay.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership</strong> 💪 – Our core value is to “empower others,” and we mean it—you’ll get a slice of n8n with equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work/life balance</strong> 🏖️ – We work hard but ensure you have time to recharge:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe:</strong> 30 days of vacation, plus