 ensure continuity and effective controls.</p></li></ul><h3>Build an AI-Native Accounting Function</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use n8n, AI tools, and modern accounting platforms to identify opportunities for automation and continuously improve workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Validate AI-generated outputs, prioritize human review where risks are highest, and maintain reliable evidence for stakeholders, regulators, and auditors.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help scale accounting processes across our growing multi-entity business, with opportunities to broaden your expertise into AR and revenue accounting over time.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3><strong>Must-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📚 Hands-on accounting experience:</strong> You have practical GL and AP/P2P experience, with solid fundamentals in journal entries, accruals, prepayments, fixed assets, and reconciliations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⚖️ Accounting standards &amp; VAT:</strong> You have working knowledge of HGB or IFRS, understand invoice requirements and VAT fundamentals, and know when to seek expert guidance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤖 AI &amp; automation mindset:</strong> You're excited to experiment with AI, build better workflows, and learn how to validate automated outputs rather than simply execute transactions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📊 Systems &amp; spreadsheet skills:</strong> You're confident using spreadsheets and accounting systems, with strong attention to coding accuracy, data quality, and financial controls.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎯 Ownership &amp; reliability:</strong> You take responsibility for daily operations, follow through on commitments, and proactively identify ways to improve how things work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💬 Clear communication:</strong> You communicate effectively in English, collaborate well across teams, and enjoy helping colleagues solve operational challenges.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Modern finance tools:</strong> You've worked with AI-native ERPs, Ramp or similar P2P platforms, Q2C tools, or workflow automation platforms like n8n.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🌍 International accounting:</strong> You have experience working across multiple entities, ideally in a global business with an expanding international footprint.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💰 SaaS &amp; revenue accounting:</strong> You're familiar with SaaS business models, multi-currency accounting, AR, or revenue recognition.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🔍 Audit &amp; qualifications:</strong> You bring an audit background or relevant accounting qualifications that strengthen your accounting expertise.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🇩🇪 German language skills:</strong> You can communicate in German, although this is not required for the role.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At n8n, you won't just process transactions — you'll help rethink how accounting works at an automation company. You'll own meaningful parts of our accounting operations, build AI-powered improvements you can see in action, and help shape a scalable finance function at one of Europe's fastest-growing startups.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll join a supportive, remote-first team where autonomy, curiosity, experimentation, and continuous learning are encouraged. Working closely with experienced colleagues, you'll have the opportunity to deepen your GL, P2P, and close expertise while gradually expanding into AR and revenue accounting as we grow.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like a challenge you're exc