ned growth numbers at a B2C or self-serve product, ideally a consumer subscription or creator tool, and can show what you changed in paying customers, conversion or acquisition cost</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are hands-on. You still build campaigns, tests and ads yourself, and you're happy doing it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have deep expertise in at least one of SEO/GEO, performance marketing or social media growth, and a good working knowledge of the others</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have a strong eye for creative and messaging, and you know how to improve an ad based on its numbers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is fully part of how you work. You build your own automations, agents and bots, and can show us some</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are analytical and comfortable in tools like PostHog, SQL and ad managers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have built something on your own, whether a company, a side project, music or a sport, and you bring that drive to work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You communicate clearly, challenge directly and take ownership without waiting for instructions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are based in Berlin or ready to relocate, and can join us in the office at least four days per week</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bonus points:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have led people before, and you make the people around you better</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with music, video, creator tools or AI products</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have built a growth function from scratch at a small company</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You make music or video yourself</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we measure success</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Within your first month, you understand our product, users and channels, own a weekly growth scorecard with clear baselines, and we have agreed on targets for the quarter. You're already running the first experiments on the biggest bottleneck.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Within 90 days, you run growth and content without the founder in the loop, messaging tests run every month with clear winners, the numbers are moving, and you're hiring the next person on the team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Within a year, marketing runs as a team with clear owners and goals, new paying customers are growing steadily against our targets, and growth no longer depends on the founder.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Benefits</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">VSOPs and profit sharing, bi-weekly team lunches, regular team events, an annual summer offsite, learning and development support, productivity tools, a headphone allowance, Deutschlandticket, and a €5,000 referral bonus.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Neural Frames is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome people with different backgrounds, experiences and perspectives, and are committed to building an inclusive and supportive workplace.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/neural-frames-gmbh/head-of-growth-ai-music-video-platform-berlin-294782","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794454815},{"slug":"senior-mechanical-systems-test-engineer-all-genders-munich-114740","company_name":"væridion","title":"Senior Mechanical Systems Test Engineer (all genders)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Mission:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a <strong>Senior Mechanical Systems Test Engineer </strong>(all genders), you will be responsible for the development, implementation, and operation of the Flight Control System (FCS) test environment (“Iron Bird”) at VÆRIDION.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will lead a major engineering project with significant cost and program impact, ensuring the successful development of a fully integrated test rig that enables system integration, validation, and certification of the aircraft’s primary and secondary flight control system.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work at the interface of mechanical systems, actuation, control, and system integration, contributing directly to the development and certification of electric aircraft.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Day-to-Day:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Test Strategy &amp; System Responsibility</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of the test concept and strategy for the Flight Control System (FCS).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define test requirements, architectures, and validation approaches for system-level testing.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure alignment of all test activities with development, safety of flight, and certification objectives.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Iron Bird Development (Test Rig Project Leadership)</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the development, implementation, and commissioning of the FCS Iron Bird test rig.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define system architecture, interfaces, and functional requirements of the test environment.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage the development of mechanical, electrical, and control system integration within the test rig.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive supplier selection, coordination, and technical oversight for test rig development (CAPEX project).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure delivery of the test rig within program timelines, budget, and technical requirements.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Test Execution &amp; System Validation</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and execute system-level test campaigns on the Iron Bird.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure reliable, high-quality test data generation and reporting.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Analyse system behaviour and support validation of flight control performance and safety.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support verification and certification activities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Test Asset Ownership</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the Iron Bird test asset, ensuring configuration control, readiness, and safe operation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish processes for operation, maintenance, and continuous improvement of the test rig.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure traceability and reproducibility of test configurations and results.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-Functional Collaboration</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with flight controls, systems engineering, structures, and test teams.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interface with design engineers to ensure testability and integration readiness.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support integration of hardware, actuators, sensors, and control systems.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Health, Safety &amp; Compliance</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Promote and uphold a strong safety culture in all test activities.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure compliance with relevant safety standards, especially for complex mechanical systems.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish risk assessments, safe operating procedures, and training for test operations.</p></li></ul></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Profile:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Degree in mechanical engineering, aerospace engineering, or a related field.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Extensive experience in testing and validation of complex mechanical or aerospace systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience in developing test rigs or large-scale test environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in leading technical projects with high complexity and impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of mechanical systems, actuation, and mechanical flight control architectures.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in system integration testing, ideally in aerospace applications.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with development of test rigs, Iron Birds, or similar system-level test environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Knowledge of instrumentation, measurement systems, and data acquisition.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of certification-driven testing and validation processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing suppliers and external partners for engineering projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong ownership mindset and ability to drive complex projects to completion.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent problem-solving and system-level thinking skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong communication and stakeholder management capabilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to operate effectively in a fast-paced and evolving environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English, German is a plus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We recognize that women and other under-represented groups are often overlooked in our industry. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every listed qualification, we still encourage you to apply. Talent and potential can’t always be captured in a checklist.</em></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why us?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be part of an ambitious team determined to shape the future of aviation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an in-office company, but we value flexibility and trust employees to manage their schedules responsibly. This may include occasional remote work or adjusting hours to accommodate personal commitments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Subsidized EGYM Wellpass membership: your (mental) health is important for us.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enjoy a subsidized lunch with a 5€ company contribution per meal on office days.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become a part of our success with virtual stock options.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Choose the option that suits your needs: either a free charging station for your electric car or a public transport job ticket as part of the Deutschlandticket.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lease a high-quality bicycle or e-bike through our JobRad program and benefit from tax advantages. Whether for your daily commute or personal use, enjoy more mobility and sustainability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pension scheme to support your long-term financial security.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work in one of our offices in Munich or Delft. Enjoy the modern Balan Campus in Munich or work inside the aerospace ecosystem at TU Delft.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Boost your professional as well as personal growth executing your own ideas and independent projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join our internal social events and retreats (e.g. cooking, game nights, sports</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">VÆRIDION was founded in 2021 to transform regional air travel with the Microliner, a 100% electric commercial aircraft. By delivering the most energy-efficient aircraft, we are building the future where clean, safe, and affordable electric aviation seamlessly connects people and businesses. We’re bringing together the brightest minds in aerospace, automotive engineering, and business to disrupt the aviation industry.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/vaeridion/senior-mechanical-systems-test-engineer-all-genders-munich-114740","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"EDMO Manufacturing & Testing Facility","created_at":1794454815},{"slug":"strategy-ops-associate-london-321135","company_name":"Slingshotai","title":"Strategy & Ops Associate","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Slingshot AI</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Slingshot AI is the team behind Ash, the first AI designed for mental health. Our mission is to make support more accessible and help people change their lives in the ways they want.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re building a world-class team by empowering individuals with the autonomy, flexibility, and support they need to do their best work. We dream big, iterate fast, and care deeply. If that sounds like you, we’d love to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our team spans machine learning, product, engineering, conversational design, clinical, growth, and operations, with offices in both New York City and London.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're a well-funded Series A company, having raised $93M from Andreessen Horowitz, Radical Ventures, Forerunner Ventures, plus top-tier tech investors involved in ElevenLabs, Captions, Shopify, Plaid, Notion, Canva, Twitch, Airtable, and many others.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is for someone who wants to learn fast, move fast and make an impact early in their career. Slingshot is a small team of senior specialists. Many of us were CTOs, CEOs or founders before we joined, and each person owns an area that a larger company would give to a whole team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will join our strategy and ops team and work closely with our Chief of Staff. Your work will be solving operational problems across teams, wherever the business needs help most. One day that might be reaching out to therapists we want to recruit as experts. The next it might be building an automated system to manage our vendor spend. Anything and everything the business needs to succeed is in scope.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Few roles let you see how a whole company runs. You will be close to the decisions on key areas across the business, learn how experienced operators make them, and own pieces of that work yourself from your first weeks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our team builds with AI and automation every day. You will learn from them how to use these tools to get more done, for yourself and for the people you support.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you will do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Give leverage to a senior team.</strong> Work with the Chief of Staff and alongside former CTOs, CEOs and founders on the problems that land on their desks each day. You take a loose ask, work out what is needed and get it done.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Act quickly to solve ambiguous problems.</strong> Take on a problem area in the business, find out what is going wrong, lay out the options and run the fix.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own how we interact with external resources.</strong> One specific area we are looking for you to own is how we source and manage contractors, agencies, vendors, and other external resources at our disposal.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Upskill yourself and your systems over time.</strong> Learn from our experts in AI and automation to stay on the forefront of how these tools can take work off of your plate.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>About you</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are early in your career and have already done a lot.</strong> You have up to three years of experience at an early-stage startup, a top consulting firm or a top investment bank, and you have a consistent track record of going above and beyond.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You can “drink from the firehose”.</strong> You have a track record of learning fast in high-intensity environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You ask the right questions, then move.</strong> Given a messy problem, you find out what you need to know and leave the rest.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have a bias to action.</strong> You will send the emails yourself today if that solves the problem, and you can tell when it is worth building something or buying it in instead.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You use AI to give yourself leverage.</strong> You explore new ways to use AI to make your work faster and better regularly and are excited to learn from experts on this.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You care about the mission.</strong> You want to help make mental health support accessible to more people.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are based in London</strong> and want to work from our London office in-person.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A chance to learn from a world-class team at a fast paced startup that is at the frontier of its field</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A chance to join a passionate tight knit team working on something to change the world</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive compensation (top of personal market) and meaningful equity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Travel between our NYC and London offices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Usual startup perks like free lunch and coffee in office plus a generous learning budget</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We cover your personal therapy</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/slingshotai/strategy-ops-associate-london-321135","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1794498031},{"slug":"senior-talent-partner-london-74629","company_name":"Getground","title":"Senior Talent Partner","description":"<h2>Senior Talent Partner, Non-Technical Hiring  (up to £80,000 base + early stage equity)</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> Hybrid (3 days in London office) <br /></p><h3>About GetGround</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">At GetGround, our mission is simple: to make property investment safer, faster, and more accessible for landlords. We believe AI can reshape the landlord journey end to end, not just improving single steps, but reimagining the entire experience of property investing. The result will be a future of buy-to-let that looks radically different from the one we know today.<br /></p><h3>The Opportunity</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a SeniorTalent Partner to own the full hiring lifecycle across sales, marketing, and corporate functions, at every level and across the UK, Philippines, and UAE. You’ll report to the VP People, and this role is critical to our ability to build a world-class organisation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is your chance to build the commercial and operational teams that will take GetGround to new markets and new customers. We’re backed by QED, one of the world’s most prestigious VC funds, with an experienced leadership team that puts real weight on culture and is relentless about hiring, engaging, and retaining world-class talent.<br /></p><h3>Why this role matters</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Every person we hire shapes the future of property investment. The people who sell, market, and run GetGround are the ones who turn our technology into growth. As our Senior Talent Partner, you’ll build the team that builds the business, and you’ll do it with the same innovative, AI-forward mindset that defines our approach to PropTech.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you’re ready to take full ownership of hiring, experiment fearlessly, and attract exceptional talent to an ambitious mission, let’s talk.<br /></p><h3>What You’ll Own</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Taking our hiring velocity, execution, and impact to the next level</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">End-to-end recruitment across sales, marketing, and corporate functions (finance, legal, operations, people and more), from entry-level to executive search</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Running multiple searches at once across the UK, Philippines, and UAE, adapting your approach to each market’s talent landscape, norms, and hiring practices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building and nurturing talent pipelines for immediate and future hiring needs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partnering with hiring managers to define roles, ideal profiles, and assessment approaches</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sourcing creatively across channels and experimenting with AI-powered recruitment tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Delivering a candidate experience that reflects our ambition and values</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tracking, analysing, and improving hiring metrics and processes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scaling our talent acquisition strategy as we grow rapidly</p></li></ul><h3>Who You Are</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own the hiring strategy for GetGround, and this is your chance to define what excellence in hiring looks like. You are:<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A resilient problem-solver.</strong> Hiring rarely goes to plan. When pipelines dry up, roles evolve mid-search, or offers fall through, you stay calm and find a way forward.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creative in your approach.</strong> You don’t rely solely on job boards and LinkedIn. You experiment with unconventional sourcing, craft messaging that stands out, and find talent in places others overlook. You know the best candidates often aren’t actively looking, and that a strong talent brand is critical to hiring well.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A market-savvy commercial hirer.</strong> You understand what great sales and marketing talent looks like, how to assess it, and what motivates it. You’re equally comfortable hiring an SDR, a Head of Marketing, or a Finance Director, and you adapt your approach to each.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Comfortable across borders.</strong> You can run searches across multiple regions and time zones, and you’re curious about how hiring differs between London, Manila, and Dubai.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI-curious and ready to experiment.</strong> You’re genuinely excited about how AI is changing recruitment and eager to test new tools, workflows, and approaches. We’re building an AI-first company, and you’ll help explore what that means for how we hire.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Relentlessly results-driven.</strong> You set clear goals and hold yourself accountable. Time to hire, pipeline conversion, and offer acceptance rates all matter to you, and you keep refining your approach to improve them.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Exceptionally organised.</strong> You juggle multiple searches across functions and geographies without missing a beat. Your processes are tight, your communication is proactive, and hiring managers trust you completely.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strategic in your thinking.</strong> You anticipate hiring needs rather than just reacting to them. You partner with leadership to understand business goals and build talent strategies that keep us ahead of our growth curve.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Scrappy and action-oriented.</strong> You know when to build the perfect system and when to move fast with what works. You’re hands-on and pragmatic, and no task is beneath you when it gets the right people in the door.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>Nice to Have</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Ashby, our ATS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience hiring in the Philippines and/or the UAE</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Background in fintech, PropTech, or high-growth startups</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building employer branding initiatives</p></li></ul><h3>This role isn’t for you if</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You want fully remote work. We’re hybrid, with 3 days in the office, and we believe passionately in the advantages of in-p