uct solutions that deliver value</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI-native expertise: you know how to embed AI into the product and your own workflow.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with design tools and/or rapid prototype software, e.g., Figma, Lovable, Claude Code, to effectively convey ideas and explore options.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Skills to prepare and deliver technical presentations to senior leadership and/or investors in an inspiring way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A self-starter mindset: you take ownership, structure ambiguous problems yourself and deliver, reliably and on time.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven success building outstanding, consumer-grade applications in complex regulated verticals (e.g. Healthtech, Fintech).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A technical background and/or deep technical understanding of common development processes.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why Join Us</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape the product from day one. Take a core PM role on the founding team of an ambitious AI healthcare startup, with real ownership over the product, how we work and, later, the product team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make healthcare work better for everyone. Help people understand and act on their own health data, and give physicians and partners the tools to spend less time on admin and more on care.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow in the heart of Zurich. Work side by side with the team in our collaborative office and benefit from our network of industry leaders, domain experts, top-tier talent and investors.</p></li></ul><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Engagement Details<br /></strong></p><p 